ectives across the investment life cycle. Leveraging our strength and scale, innovation and platforms, and industry expertise, we are an essential partner to our clients. In all aspects of our business, we work toward a singular purpose: to help create better outcomes for the world's investors and the people they serve.","zh":"道富銀行是全球領先的機構投資者金融服務提供者之一，包括投資服務、市場和融資解決方案以及投資管理。我們的客戶——資產管理者和所有者、保險公司、財富管理者、官方機構和中央銀行——依賴我們提供支持他們在整個投資生命週期業務目標的解決方案。憑藉我們的實力和規模、創新和平台以及行業專業知識，我們成為客戶的重要合作夥伴。在我們業務的各個方面，我們都致力於實現一個單一目標：幫助世界投資者及其服務的人們創造更好的成果。"},{"en":"Through our subsidiaries, including our principal banking subsidiary, State Street Bank and Trust Company, referred to as State Street Bank, we operate in more than 100 geographic markets worldwide, providing a broad range of financial products and services to institutional investors globally. As of December 31, 2025, we reported $53.80 trillion in AUC/A and $5.67 trillion in AUM. We had consolidated total assets of $366.05 billion, consolidated total deposits of $274.35 billion, consolidated total shareholders' equity of $27.84 billion and approximately 52,000 employees as of December 31, 2025.","zh":"透過我們的子公司，包括我們的主要銀行子公司道富銀行和信託公司（簡稱道富銀行），我們在全球 100 多個地區市場開展業務，為全球機構投資者提供廣泛的金融產品和服務。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們報告的 AUC/A 為 53.80 兆美元，AUM 為 5.67 兆美元。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們的合併總資產為 3,660.5 億美元，合併總存款為 2,743.5 億美元，合併總股東權益為 278.4 億美元，擁有約 52,000 名員工。"},{"en":"State Street Corporation, referred to as the Parent Company, was organized in 1969 under the laws of the Commonwealth of Massachusetts, and is a bank holding company that has elected to be treated as a financial holding company under the Bank Holding Company Act of 1956. The Parent Company is a source of financial and managerial","zh":"道富銀行（State Street Corporation，簡稱「母公司」）於 1969 年根據馬薩諸塞州聯邦法律成立，是一家銀行控股公司，根據 1956 年《銀行控股公司法》選擇被視為金融控股公司。母公司是財務和管理的來源。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We operate in a highly competitive environment in all areas of our business globally. Our competitors include a broad range of financial institutions and servicing companies, including other custodial banks, deposit-taking institutions, investment management firms, insurance companies, mutual funds, broker/dealers, investment banks, benefits consultants, investment analytics businesses, business service and software companies, technology companies, data providers and information services firms. As our businesses grow and markets and new technologies, including artificial intelligence, evolve, we may encounter increasing and new forms of competition around the world.","zh":"我們在全球所有業務領域都處於高度競爭的環境中。我們的競爭對手包括廣泛的金融機構和服務公司，包括其他託管銀行、存款機構、投資管理公司、保險公司、共同基金、經紀人/交易商、投資銀行、福利顧問、投資分析企業、商業服務和軟體公司、技術公司、數據提供者和資訊服務公司。隨著我們業務的成長、市場和新技術（包括人工智慧）的發展，我們可能會在世界各地遇到越來越多的新形式的競爭。"},{"en":"Technological advances, economies of scale, required levels of capital, pricing, quality and scope of services, and sales and marketing are critical to our Investment Servicing line of business. For our Investment Management line of business, key competitive factors include expertise, experience, availability of related service offerings, quality of service, price, efficiency of our products and services, and performance.","zh":"技術進步、規模經濟、所需的資本水準、定價、服務品質和範圍以及銷售和行銷對於我們的投資服務業務至關重要。對於我們的投資管理業務線，關鍵競爭因素包括專業知識、經驗、相關服務產品的可用性、服務品質、價格、產品和服務的效率以及績效。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Investment Servicing","val":11331000000,"zh":"投資服務"},{"name":"Investment Management","val":2634000000,"zh":"投資管理"}],"total":13944000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Revenue From Fees","val":10980000000,"zh":"收費收入"},{"name":"Account Servicing","val":5324000000,"zh":"帳戶服務"},{"name":"Interest Income Net","val":2960000000,"zh":"利息收入淨額"},{"name":"Management Services","val":2398000000,"zh":"管理服務"},{"name":"Foreign Exchange Trading Services","val":1614000000,"zh":"外匯交易服務"},{"name":"Processing Servicesand Other","val":903000000,"zh":"加工服務及其他"},{"name":"Securities Financing Services","val":505000000,"zh":"證券融資服務"},{"name":"Other Fee Revenue","val":236000000,"zh":"其他費用收入"},{"name":"Total Other Income","val":4000000,"zh":"其他收入總額"}],"total":13944000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":8008000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":5936000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":13944000000}},"peers":["NTRS","BNY","PNC","MTB","FITB"]}}